            For paver driveways, don't use pedestrian-rated polymeric sand — specify <strong class="text-white">Unilock Enduro Sand</strong>. For light-colored or expensive pavers, use <strong class="text-white">DOMINATOR no-haze formula</strong> and treat hazing prevention as the top priority. In all cases: ensure the pavers are bone dry, remove every grain of excess sand before activation, and use only a gentle mist. Technique is 70% of the result.
